                                                               in Kidney Disease and Type 2 Diabetes
                                                           B. Pitt, G. Filippatos, R. Agarwal, S.D. Anker, G.L. Bakris, P. Rossing, A. Joseph,
                                                                        P. Kolkhof, C. Nowack, P. Schloemer, and L.M. Ruilope,
